<h1 style="text-align: left; line-height: 1.1; font-weight: bold; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 26px; color: #000000; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="left">Make the Holidays Brighter</h1>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #444446; margin: 0 0 10px;">Dear Columbus Recreation and Parks Supporter,</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #444446; margin: 0 0 10px;">The Holiday Season is a special time for families. A time when families reunite, share in holiday traditions and enjoy time together. However, for some families the holidays bring a time of great financial challenge and stress.</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #444446; margin: 0 0 10px;">Last year the Adopt a Center program brought joy to thousands of people thanks to the generosity of this community. Hot meals, warm winter items and gifts were distributed across 25 Columbus Recreation and Parks Community Centers.</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #444446; margin: 0 0 10px;">This year the need will be greater. We anticipate providing at least 7,000 meals and exceeding the number of gifts and warm winter items needed last year. I’m writing to ask you to consider supporting our effort this year.</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #444446; margin: 0 0 10px;">There are several ways to help—you can purchase a toy, make a financial contribution or recruit your company, organization or family to join in. All details can be found at the links below.</p>
<ul>
<li style="text-align: left; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #444446; margin: 0 0 7px;"><span style="text-decoration: underline; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><a href="https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/OHCCC/2022/07/28/file_attachments/2230384/AAC_FactSheet_2022.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: #003087; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">Overview of the Program</a></span></li>
<li style="text-align: left; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #444446; margin: 0 0 7px;"><span style="text-decoration: underline; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><a href="https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/OHCCC/2022/07/28/file_attachments/2230386/AdoptACenter_Sponsorship_Sheet2022.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: #003087; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">Sponsorship Details</a> </span></li>
<li style="text-align: left; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #444446; margin: 0 0 7px;"><span style="text-decoration: underline; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><a href="https://www.crpfoundation.org/adoptacenter-donate/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" target="_blank" title="Make a donation to the Adopt a Center program" rel="noopener" style="color: #003087; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">Make a Donation</a></span></li>
<li style="text-align: left; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #444446; margin: 0 0 7px;">
<a href="https://www.amazon.com/hz/wishlist/ls/97QAS92KRISA?ref_=abls_nvfly_yl&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" target="_blank" title="Amazon Wish List " rel="noopener" style="color: #003087; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;"><span style="text-decoration: underline; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">Purchase a</span><span style="text-decoration: underline; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"> </span><span style="text-decoration: underline; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">Gift</span></a>: <em>Gifts will be delivered directly to Columbus Recreation and Parks for distribution</em>
</li>
</ul>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #444446; margin: 0 0 10px;">Please contact Erika Shemberg at <a href="mailto:ejshemberg@columbus.gov" style="color: #003087; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">ejshemberg@columbus.gov</a> with any questions.</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #444446; margin: 0 0 10px;">Thank you for considering!</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #444446; margin: 0 0 10px;">Sincerely, </p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #444446; margin: 0 0 10px;">~Bernita</p>
<img class="govd_template_image" src="https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/fancy_images/OHCCC/2022/01/5364244/bareese-sig1_original.png" style="width: 150px; height: auto !important; max-height: auto !important; border: none;" alt="Bernita A Reese Signature" width="150" height="52"><p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #444446; margin: 0 0 10px;">Bernita A. Reese, CPRP<br>Director, Columbus Recreation and Parks Department</p>
